{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The crystal must endure. The horde will not relent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MageGuard Tower</i> is a roguelike tower defense game where thousands of monsters surge across the battlefield, colliding and clawing their way toward your crystal. These enemies are driven by physics, shoving through tight chokepoints, scaling past obstacles, and shoving one another in their relentless advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps and randomized challenges force you to adapt, rebuild, and discover new strategies to withstand the swarm. Unlock new towers, accessories, and upgrades over time as you hone your defenses and grow your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b49b4c073fc1c0fc3749b719df18e7b2.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b49b4c073fc1c0fc3749b719df18e7b2.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b49b4c073fc1c0fc3749b719df18e7b2.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Towers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, wield <strong>10 distinct towers</strong>, each designed to control the battlefield in unique ways. From raw elemental damage to crushing knockback projectiles, from debilitation effects that weaken the enemy to bulwarks that shield the crystal itself, every tower you place shapes the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and experiment with over <strong>50 accessories</strong>, each one altering or enhancing tower behavior. Combine effects, create synergies, and carve your own path of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endlessly Changing Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is procedurally generated. Positioning load out your blocks and utilize pits to your advantage, or watch empty blocks become pathways to your defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock towers, accessories, and support upgrades as you progress. Each run brings new tools and new enemies, forcing you to adapt strategies and experiment with builds. Survival is never guaranteed\u2014but every attempt brings you closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless, physics-driven swarms that feel alive and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique towers and 50+ accessories at launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable progression that expands your defenses over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player roguelike tower defense experience where every run matters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966920?t=1766851496","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/fe3a599e7b7776d28f5e4cbd3e0ce41e4c194283/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766851496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/ef8eacad905b372efdb6042444002ea849c28b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766851496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/ef8eacad905b372efdb6042444002ea849c28b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766851496","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option