, every tower you place shapes the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and experiment with over <strong>50 accessories</strong>, each one altering or enhancing tower behavior. Combine effects, create synergies, and carve your own path of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/82bf963c303c062d6b9a329922ebc0f7.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endlessly Changing Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is procedurally generated. Positioning load out your blocks and utilize pits to your advantage, or watch empty blocks become pathways to your defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/1925a37f71b1463c76088777031c5c38.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock towers, accessories, and support upgrades as you progress. Each run brings new tools and new enemies, forcing you to adapt strategies and experiment with builds. Survival is never guaranteed\u2014but every attempt brings you closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.poster.avif?t=1766851496\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.webm?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/extras/b7b750597db6cd225662fd46a85c6226.mp4?t=1766851496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless, physics-driven swarms that feel alive and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique towers and 50+ accessories at launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable progression that expands your defenses over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player roguelike tower defense experience where every run matters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Daniel Batista"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966920/d5675626eca4f283c61b3a62e513a7c7ca35f5e5/header.jpg?t=1766851496","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966920/1783985091/430db91a713ed7b1591f723c3ad6a5c33d83dded/1757271887/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757461328","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966920/1783985091/430db91a713ed7b1591f